      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P018 identifies the prospective causal finding; P020 explicitly states its limited historical explanatory reach."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C027.signal_basis",
    "value": "Making attachment responsibility explicit is followed by reproducible decreases in missing attachments across comparable orders and observation periods, using consistent inspection intervals. Safe simulation may additionally show recurrence under restored ambiguity and improvement when clarity returns.",
    "scope": "Prospective attachment outcomes and optional fictitious-order simulation; simulation does not establish live-effect magnitude, and temporal association does not exclude alternative causes.",
